(text "NOTES" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 220.98 190.5 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c1f06482-3a2a-5c41-b735-5e92d22f2081"))
(text "1  PS1 (12 V) feeds the I/O board and motor only. PS2, the Raspberry Pi 27 W USB-C supply, powers the Pi 5\n   so it negotiates 5 A and unlocks 1.6 A USB output for the ReSpeaker.\n2  The ReSpeaker is powered over W3; its LM48511 amplifier drives LS1 (4 ohm minimum load).\n3  W2 joins the I/O board to the SBC header pin-for-pin; only pins 1, 15, 29, 31, 32 and grounds are used.\n4  Fit the GPIO stacking header supplied with the AI HAT+ 2; W2 plugs onto its top pins.\n" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 220.98 195.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "88edb6a9-7051-5a8d-a437-977fb308ea19"))
